# puku-cli harness state — local-only, auto-mutated by the CLI tool.
# Everything under `.puku-cli/` is per-machine / per-install state:
#   * `settings.local.json` records per-machine behaviour (allowed commands,
#     hooks) and is mutated every time the CLI runs.
#   * `skills/` is restored locally from `skills-lock.json` (the integrity
#     manifest at the project root) by the puku-cli skill-fetch mechanism.
#     Skills ship from the third-party source `iart-ai/web-animation-skills`
#     referenced in `skills-lock.json` — they shouldn't bloat the repo.
.puku-cli/

# Build / cache artefacts
.cache/
.next/
